      "declaration": "AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.FunctionalInequalities.GaussianCompactLogSobolev.compact_gaussian_logSobolev",
      "title": "Actual compact scalar Gaussian log-Sobolev inequality",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.06906v1#S4.E6",
          "label": "FIRST S4.E6 omitted GaussianLSI background; pinned SLT GaussianLSI/OneDimGLSICompSmo.lean:45-82 compact limit closure; authored actual Bool count alternative",
          "scope": "Authored compact C2 scalar Gaussian homogeneous entropy <=2 derivative-square integral, signed f and zero mass included. Only f/C2/compact analytic premises; true Gaussian/count L1 and finite entropy/energy comparison are internal actual34/36/37 outputs. Exact variance1. Not full noncompact/Hilbert GaussianLSI, T2/FIRST4.6/main/work/composition. Actual37 final source/exactcommit/shared readiness is mandatory before claim or proof search. Focused3180PASS for zero observer and concrete signed smooth compact cutoff. Standard3 only. Independent wholeproof/blind/source/exactcommit and shared publication remain separate."
        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/YuanheZ/lean-stat-learning-theory/blob/d0f506f0a695018265dccb33bcb05e2f5ca1c876/SLT/GaussianLSI/OneDimGLSICompSmo.lean#L45",
